    "answer": {
      "short": "$20\\pi\\text{ cm}^2$",
      "worked": "The angle is in radians.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}A&=\\frac12r^2\\theta\\\\A&=\\frac12(10)^2\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{5}\\right)\\\\A&=20\\pi\\text{ cm}^2\\end{align*}$$",
